abstract: "QuantyCoin is a zero-mock, high-throughput Layer-1 proof-of-work blockchain ecosystem engineered with pure mathematical Secp256k1/Ed25519 cryptography, atomic UTXO reorganization state management, dynamic LWMA-1 difficulty adjustment, Stratum pool protocol, and native Qt6 Cyberpunk desktop GUI suites."
